# TLSET r1: a live note on an assigned key is recorded into the take and pinned (takedump). The
# replay's own note stream is not compared: it starts 256 samples early (a T9i offset, see the report).
wait 300
tap GLO
tap SEL
tapkey w0
turn ALGO 2
tapkey w0
turn ALGO -3
songseed
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
wait 50
tap EDIT
tap SEL
key 22 down
turn PRESET 16 80
key 22 up
expect keyclip22 38
tap EDIT
expect setup 0
tap REC
tap PLAY
wait-bar 1
expect takerec 1
eventsnotes rec_notes.txt
tapkey 7
wait-bar 1
key 22 down
wait 300
key 22 up
wait-bar 3
waitbarabs 7
eventsstop
tap REC
wait-bar 2
expect takehas 1
takedump take_rec.txt
tap PLAY
wait 400
takeplay
waitbarabs 7
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect heldnotes 0
